          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "When connecting complex enterprise environments involving **MYOB Acumatica**, **SAP**, **CRM platforms**, and **Microsoft 365** in the Newcastle / Hunter Region (NSW), you generally need a specialist capable of handling both modern cloud REST APIs (Acumatica, M365) and enterprise ERP service layers (SAP). \n\nThe top system integration and ERP specialists with strong local Newcastle ties or active on-the-ground support across the Hunter region include:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Locally Headquartered in Newcastle\n\n* **Diamond IT** *(HQ: Warabrook / Newcastle)*\n  * **Core Strengths:** Microsoft 365, Dynamics 365 / CRM, Azure Cloud, and custom API/database integrations.\n  * **Best For:** Connecting your Microsoft ecosystem (Office 365, Teams, Power Platform, SharePoint, Dynamics CRM) to external ERP endpoints. If you already have your ERP configured and need a trusted local engineering partner to bridge CRM workflows, automate data syncs, and leverage Azure Logic Apps or Power Automate, Diamond IT is the standout Newcastle-based provider.\n* **Strategic Group** *(HQ: Newcastle)*\n  * **Core Strengths:** Managed IT, business systems support, Microsoft 365 environments, and deep historical expertise in accounting/finance IT architectures (including the MYOB partner ecosystem).\n  * **Best For:** Mid-market businesses looking for Newcastle-based infrastructure management and integration support around core finance and Microsoft environments.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Multi-ERP & MYOB Acumatica Specialists Servicing Newcastle\n\nBecause MYOB Acumatica and SAP implementations require specialized vendor certifications, many Newcastle organizations partner with regional NSW ERP consultancies that operate directly in the Hunter:\n\n* **Leverage Technologies** *(Sydney & Regional NSW)*\n  * **Core Strengths:** Dual accredited as an **MYOB Acumatica Platinum Partner** and an **SAP Gold Partner** (SAP Business One & SAP Cloud ERP).\n  * **Best For:** The specific scenario of connecting or migrating between **both SAP and MYOB Acumatica**. Leverage Technologies is one of the few Australian partners with deep, dedicated practices in both software families, as well as integrating them with modern CRMs and Microsoft 365 tooling.\n* **OneKloudX** *(Newcastle & Sydney Offices)*\n  * **Core Strengths:** Cloud ERP deployment, MYOB Acumatica implementation, and middleware data synchronisation.\n  * **Best For:** Organizations with a Newcastle presence that want on-site MYOB Acumatica consulting paired with CRM and supply chain integration.\n* **Cloud Factory** *(NSW / National)*\n  * **Core Strengths:** Cross-ERP expertise across MYOB Acumatica, SAP Business One, and Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central.\n  * **Best For:** Independent ERP evaluation, process re-engineering, and integrating Acumatica workflows with third-party logistics and CRM suites.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Dedicated Integration & iPaaS Developers (Custom Connectors)\n\nIf your ERP and CRM systems are already deployed and you strictly need an integration layer to synchronize data (e.g., bi-directional order/inventory sync, customer accounts, M365 notifications, automated invoicing):\n\n* **MyIntegrator** *(Australian Specialist)*\n  * **Core Strengths:** Purpose-built connectors and custom iPaaS implementations connecting MYOB Acumatica, SAP, major CRMs (Salesforce, HubSpot, Dynamics), and e-commerce platforms.\n  * **Best For:** Businesses requiring pre-built or custom automated middleware without having to hire a full ERP implementation team.\n\n---\n\n### How to Choose the Right Partner:\n\n1. **If the core challenge is the Microsoft & CRM ecosystem:** Go with a local Newcastle partner like **Diamond IT** to build out Power Automate / Azure Integration Services pipelines that interface with your ERPs via REST APIs.\n2. **If your project involves complex SAP-to-Acumatica accounting or data transfer:** Choose **Leverage Technologies**, as they possess certified consultants across both specific ERP codebases.\n3. **If you need an MYOB Acumatica rollout with local Newcastle support:** Reach out to **OneKloudX** or **Leverage Technologies** to run the discovery and systems integration together.",
              "thoughtSignature": ""
            }
          ],
          "role": "model"
        },
